WEBVTT

00:18.206 --> 00:35.078
Switch

00:35.118 --> 00:37.880
to the floor, we're cutting the wire.

00:40.602 --> 00:43.625
Leaving the city, feeling the fire.

00:46.166 --> 00:49.028
You wanted a spark, we're giving you flames.

00:49.088 --> 00:52.069
We're done with the rules, we're done with the

00:52.129 --> 00:59.634
games. Hey! Push it to the red line, never

00:59.694 --> 01:02.075
looking back. Running off the rails, now

01:02.195 --> 01:04.877
jumping off the track. Hold on tight, we're

01:04.917 --> 01:09.059
losing control. This is the rhythm of a restless

01:09.339 --> 01:09.619
soul.

01:14.912 --> 01:18.256
The needle is shaking, tearing the street.

01:20.859 --> 01:24.122
Burning the rubber, feeling the heat.

01:26.405 --> 01:28.567
They're flashing the lights, they're sounding

01:28.607 --> 01:31.430
the bell, but we're riding this rocket all the

01:31.490 --> 01:32.111
way to hell.

01:37.388 --> 01:40.630
Push it to the red line, never looking back

01:40.810 --> 01:43.491
Running off the rails now, jumping off the track

01:43.691 --> 01:47.413
Hold on tight, we're losing control This is the

01:47.473 --> 01:50.074
rhythm of a restless soul

02:12.607 --> 02:19.162
FASTER! FASTER! TEAR THE SYSTEM DOWN! FASTER!

02:19.784 --> 02:21.368
FASTER! WE RUN!

02:49.257 --> 02:52.479
Push it to a red line, never looking back.

02:52.659 --> 02:54.960
Running off the rails now, jumping off the

02:54.980 --> 02:58.282
track. Hold on tight, we're losing control.

02:58.782 --> 03:03.645
This is the rhythm of a restless soul.

03:05.406 --> 03:08.148
Red line! Red line! Yeah!

